al solution must be taken with food.",\n      "citations": [\n        {\n          "set_id": "4b1caefa-e6a2-42f3-9194-6dc1dd9e6d85",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0003",\n          "section": "2.3 Dosage Recommendations in Adults",\n          "supporting_quote": "Lopinavir and ritonavir can be given in once daily or twice daily dosing regimen at dosages noted in Tables 1 and 2."\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "4b1caefa-e6a2-42f3-9194-6dc1dd9e6d85",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0004",\n          "section": "Table 1. Recommended Dosage in Adults – Lopinavir and Ritonavir Once Daily Regimen",\n          "supporting_quote": "80 mg/20 mg per mL Oral Solution 800 mg/200 mg (10 mL) once daily"\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "4b1caefa-e6a2-42f3-9194-6dc1dd9e6d85",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0005",\n          "section": "Table 2. Recommended Dosage in Adults – Lopinavir and Ritonavir Twice Daily Regimen",\n          "supporting_quote": "80 mg/20 mg per mL Oral Solution 400 mg/100 mg (5 mL) twice daily"\n        }\n      ],\n      "structured_fields": {\n        "dose": "800 mg/200 mg or 400 mg/100 mg",\n        "unit": "mg",\n        "route": "oral",\n        "frequency": "once daily or twice daily",\n        "population": "adults",\n        "max_daily_dose": "800 mg/200 mg",\n        "citation_passages": ["PASSAGE_0003", "PASSAGE_0004", "PASSAGE_0005"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "qid": "55d09c5df742eaec",\n      "status": "ANSWERED",\n      "answer": "The recommended dosage of emtricitabine, rilpivirine and tenofovir disoproxil fumarate tablets in adult and pediatric patients weighing at least 35 kg is one tablet taken orally once daily with food. Each tablet contains 200 mg of emtricitabine, 25 mg of rilpivirine, and 300 mg of tenofovir disoproxil fumarate.",\n      "citations": [\n        {\n          "set_id": "d9a4185e-43fa-4aeb-9b0f-8db01b166038",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0003",\n          "section": "2.2 Recommended Dosage",\n          "supporting_quote": "The recommended dosage of emtricitabine, rilpivirine and tenofovir disoproxil fumarate tablets in adult and pediatric patients weighing at least 35 kg is one tablet taken orally once daily with food ."\n        }\n      ],\n      "structured_fields": {\n        "dose": "1 tablet",\n        "unit": "tablet",\n        "route": "oral",\n        "frequency": "once daily",\n        "population": "adult and pediatric patients weighing at least 35 kg",\n        "max_daily_dose": "1 tablet",\n        "citation_passages": ["PASSAGE_0003"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "qid": "005acaea4542b5ca",\n      "status": "ANSWERED",\n      "answer": "Emtricitabine, rilpivirine and tenofovir disoproxil fumarate tablets should be taken orally once daily with food.",\n      "citations": [\n        {\n          "set_id": "d9a4185e-43fa-4aeb-9b0f-8db01b166038",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0003",\n          "section": "2.2 Recommended Dosage",\n          "supporting_quote": "The recommended dosage of emtricitabine, rilpivirine and tenofovir disoproxil fumarate tablets in adult and pediatric patients weighing at least 35 kg is one tablet taken orally once daily with food ."\n        }\n      ],\n      "structured_fields": {\n        "dose": None,\n        "unit": None,\n        "route": "oral",\n        "frequency": "once daily",\n        "population": "adult and pediatric patients weighing at least 35 kg",\n        "max_daily_dose": None,\n        "citation_passages": ["PASSAGE_0003"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "qid": "2566741a8a58fd5d",\n      "status": "ANSWERED",\n      "answer": "CELECOXIB capsules are administered orally and can be given without regard to timing of meals. For patients who have difficulty swallowing capsules, the contents of a celecoxib capsule can be carefully emptied onto a level teaspoon of cool or room temperature applesauce and ingested immediately with water.",\n      "citations": [\n        {\n          "set_id": "27f17ae7-939b-402e-9498-3b6611104089",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0008",\n          "section": "2.1 General Dosing Instructions",\n          "supporting_quote": "These doses can be given without regard to timing of meals."\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "27f17ae7-939b-402e-9498-3b6611104089",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0011",\n          "section": "2.4 Juvenile Rheumatoid Arthritis",\n          "supporting_quote": "For patients who have difficulty swallowing capsules, the contents of a celecoxib capsule can be added to applesauce. The entire capsule contents are carefully emptied onto a level teaspoon of cool or room temperature applesauce and ingested immediately with water."\n        }\n      ],\n      "structured_fields": {\n        "dose": None,\n        "unit": None,\n        "route": "oral",\n        "frequency": None,\n        "population": None,\n        "max_daily_dose": None,\n        "citation_passages": ["PASSAGE_0008", "PASSAGE_0011"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "qid": "0de6259e34606d2d",\n      "status": "ANSWERED",\n      "answer": "The recommended dosage of CELECOXIB varies by indication: For Osteoarthritis (OA), the dosage is 200 mg per day administered as a single dose or as 100 mg twice daily. For Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA), the dosage is 100 mg to 200 mg twice daily. For Ankylosing Spondylitis (AS), the dosage is 200 mg daily in single or divided doses. For Juvenile Rheumatoid Arthritis (JRA) in patients 2 years and older, the dosage is based on weight: 50 mg twice daily for patients 10 kg to 25 kg, and 100 mg twice daily for patients over 25 kg. For Management of Acute Pain and Treatment of Primary Dysmenorrhea, the dosage is 400 mg initially, followed by an additional 200 mg dose if needed on the first day, and on subsequent days, 200 mg twice daily as needed.",\n      "citations": [\n        {\n          "set_id": "27f17ae7-939b-402e-9498-3b6611104089",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0009",\n          "section": "2.2 Osteoarthritis",\n          "supporting_quote": "For OA, the dosage is 200 mg per day administered as a single dose or as 100 mg twice daily."\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "27f17ae7-939b-402e-9498-3b6611104089",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0010",\n          "section": "2.3 Rheumatoid Arthritis",\n          "supporting_quote": "For RA, the dosage is 100 mg to 200 mg twice daily."\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "27f17ae7-939b-402e-9498-3b6611104089",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0011",\n          "section": "2.4 Juvenile Rheumatoid Arthritis",\n          "supporting_quote": "For JRA, the dosage for pediatric patients (age 2 years and older) is based on weight. For patients ≥10 kg to \uf0a325 kg the recommended dose is 50 mg twice daily. For patients >25 kg the recommended dose is 100 mg twice daily."\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "27f17ae7-939b-402e-9498-3b6611104089",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0012",\n          "section": "2.5 Ankylosing Spondylitis",\n          "supporting_quote": "For AS, the dosage of celecoxib capsules is 200 mg daily in single (once per day) or divided (twice per day) doses."\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "27f17ae7-939b-402e-9498-3b6611104089",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0013",\n          "section": "2.6 Management of Acute Pain and Treatment of Primary Dysmenorrhea",\n          "supporting_quote": "For management of Acute Pain and Treatment of Primary Dysmenorrhea, the dosage is 400 mg initially, followed by an additional 200 mg dose if needed on the first day. On subsequent days, the recommended dose is 200 mg twice daily as needed."\n        }\n      ],\n      "structured_fields": {\n        "dose": "100 mg, 200 mg, or 400 mg",\n        "unit": "mg",\n        "route": "oral",\n        "frequency": "once daily or twice daily",\n        "population": "adults and pediatric patients 2 years and older",\n        "max_daily_dose": "400 mg",\n        "citation_passages": ["PASSAGE_0009", "PASSAGE_0010", "PASSAGE_0011", "PASSAGE_0012", "PASSAGE_0013"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "qid": "85c49de5de841cb9",\n      "status": "ANSWERED",\n      "answer": "The recommended starting dosage of lenalidomide depends on the indication: For Multiple Myeloma (MM) in combination therapy, the recommended starting dose is 25 mg orally once daily on Days 1 to 21 of repeated 28-day cycles; for maintenance therapy following auto-HSCT, the starting dose is 10 mg once daily continuously. For Myelodysplastic Syndromes (MDS), the starting dose is 10 mg daily. For Mantle Cell Lymphoma (MCL), the starting dose is 25 mg daily orally on Days 1 to 21 of repeated 28-day cycles. For Follicular Lymphoma (FL) or Marginal Zone Lymphoma (MZL), the starting dose is 20 mg orally once daily on Days 1 to 21 of repeated 28-day cycles in combination with a rituximab product.",\n      "citations": [\n        {\n          "set_id": "ed7a3099-ce31-4865-b212-358d9ff6261b",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0009",\n          "section": "2.1 Recommended Dosage for Multiple Myeloma",\n          "supporting_quote": "The recommended starting dose of lenalidomide is 25 mg orally once daily on Days 1 to 21 of repeated 28-day cycles in combination with dexamethasone."\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "ed7a3099-ce31-4865-b212-358d9ff6261b",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0010",\n          "section": "Lenalidomide Maintenance Therapy Following Auto-HSCT",\n          "supporting_quote": "The recommended starting dose of lenalidomide is 10 mg once daily continuously (Days 1 to 28 of repeated 28-day cycles) until disease progression or unacceptable toxicity."\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "ed7a3099-ce31-4865-b212-358d9ff6261b",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0015",\n          "section": "2.2 Recommended Dosage for Myelodysplastic Syndromes",\n          "supporting_quote": "The recommended starting dose of lenalidomide is 10 mg daily."\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "ed7a3099-ce31-4865-b212-358d9ff6261b",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0019",\n          "section": "2.3 Recommended Dosage for Mantle Cell Lymphoma",\n          "supporting_quote": "The recommended starting dose of lenalidomide is 25 mg/day orally on Days 1 to 21 of repeated 28-day cycles for relapsed or refractory mantle cell lymphoma."\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "ed7a3099-ce31-4865-b212-358d9ff6261b",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0022",\n          "section": "2.4 Recommended Dosage for Follicular Lymphoma or Marginal Zone Lymphoma",\n          "supporting_quote": "The recommended starting dose of lenalidomide is 20 mg orally once daily on Days 1 to 21 of repeated 28-day cycles for up to 12 cycles of treatment in combination with a rituximab-product."\n        }\n      ],\n      "structured_fields": {\n        "dose": "10 mg, 20 mg, or 25 mg",\n        "unit": "mg",\n        "route": "oral",\n        "frequency": "once daily",\n        "population": "adults",\n        "max_daily_dose": "25 mg",\n        "citation_passages": ["PASSAGE_0009", "PASSAGE_0010", "PASSAGE_0015", "PASSAGE_0019", "PASSAGE_0022"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "qid": "0d262ce5d03f7c38",\n      "status": "ANSWERED",\n      "answer": "Lenalidomide should be taken orally once daily at about the same time each day, either with or without food. The capsules should be swallowed whole with water and should not be opened, broken, or chewed.",\n      "citations": [\n        {\n          "set_id": "ed7a3099-ce31-4865-b212-358d9ff6261b",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0032",\n          "section": "2.7 Administration",\n          "supporting_quote": "Advise patients to take lenalidomide orally at about the same time each day, either with or without food. Advise patients to swallow lenalidomide capsules whole with water and not to open, break, or chew them."\n        },\n        {\n          "set_id": "ed7a3099-ce31-4865-b212-358d9ff6261b",\n          "passage_id": "PASSAGE_0126",\n          "section": "Dosing Instructions",\n          "supporting_quote": "Lenalidomide should be taken once daily at about the same time each day, Lenalidomide may be taken either with or without food. The capsules should not be opened, broken, or chewed. Lenalidomide should be swallowed whole with water."\n        }\n      ],\n      "structured_fields": {\n        "dose": None,\n        "unit": None,\n        "route": "oral",\n        "frequency": "once daily",\n        "population": "adults",\n        "max_daily_dose": None,\n        "citation_passages": ["PASSAGE_0032", "PASSAGE_0126"]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nwith open(\'/workspace/answers.json\', \'w\') as f:\n    json.dump(answers_data, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\nprint("Done creating answers.json!")\nEOF\npython3 make_answers.py\n'] min_timeout_sec: 2.0 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
